{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、選抜発表がありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し更新が遅くなったため"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配してくださっていた方すみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中々、文章がまとまらず"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の更新になりましたm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してしてくれてるみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の9thシングルもアンダーでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8thでは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオのMCをさせて頂いたりして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しいことにも挑戦できました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(まだ乃木ののMCをやっているので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよかったら聞いてください)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと勉強して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとつひとつの仕事を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切にして成長していきたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もアンダーですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の出来ることを全力でやって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また選抜に選んでいただけるように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"精一杯頑張ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜に入ることが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全てではないと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はここにいるからには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上を目指していきたいです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宜しくお願いしますm(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの応援が私の支えです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントや握手会・ライブなどで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してくれることが何よりも勇気づけられ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち込んだときも頑張ろう！！と思えます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は皆さんの期待に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現状では中々答えられていません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恩返しできるかといえば難しくって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間がかかるかもしれません(;_;)。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでも一歩一歩進んで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかは期待や応援に答え、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"恩返しをしたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というか、します！！！><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よかったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それまで待っていてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2014/05/15/8143769/0000.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}